ations. Amodei has said he will not vote for his own party's successor.\n\nPolling is sparse and dated, but available surveys show a single-digit race, and one ratings outlet recently moved the contest to a toss-up while most still call it likely or leaning Republican. Prediction markets give Democrats roughly a three-in-ten chance. A Republican-leaning electorate and Flippo's financial edge point to a competitive but Republican-favored finish, tempered by a national environment running against the GOP.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.213, "margin": -4.52}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2977, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2868, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2952, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2127, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2908, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.3379, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.3508, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.3896, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.3448, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.3118, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2576, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2807, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1915, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2968, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.3004, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2172, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2027, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.2837, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.2377, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.2769, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.2611, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.2188, "margin": -4.8}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.2838, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.2535, "margin": -3.7}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.2917, "margin": -3